  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening international digital cooperation to create an enabling environment for human centred digital transformation anchored in the WSIS+20 and Global Digital Compact framework</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Aiming to equip Member States with comprehensive policy advice and capacity-building on AI and digital transformation, this workplan focuses on assessing national internet environments and facilitating multistakeholder-shaped, actionable policy recommendations. This encompasses also:  lead-facilitating UNESCO&apos;s implementation of the WSIS outcomes and creating synergies with multistakeholder and UN processes, Global Dialogue on AI Governance.
The focus will be given to enhancing ICT Ministry capacities for digital transformation, including effective leadership and facilitating multistakeholder cooperation, including through the IUI multi-stakeholder board meetings and UNESCO&#x2019;s SPARK Alliance.</narrative>
  </description>
